0:{"buildId":"7afh9cBoHBO9HIwX4Lcyt","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","$L2",null,{"toc":[{"depth":2,"url":"#the-short-version","title":"The short version"},{"depth":2,"url":"#two-licences-one-repository","title":"Two licences, one repository"},{"depth":2,"url":"#the-business-source-licensed-modules","title":"The Business Source Licensed modules"},{"depth":2,"url":"#nothing-in-the-binary-enforces-any-of-this","title":"Nothing in the binary enforces any of this"},{"depth":3,"url":"#metrics-are-always-on","title":"Metrics are always on"},{"depth":3,"url":"#persistent-workers-activate-from-the-action-not-from-your-config","title":"Persistent workers activate from the action, not from your config"},{"depth":2,"url":"#what-the-open-source-build-does-not-limit","title":"What the open-source build does not limit"},{"depth":2,"url":"#what-cloud-and-enterprise-add","title":"What Enterprise adds"},{"depth":2,"url":"#telling-what-you-are-running","title":"Telling what you are running"},{"depth":2,"url":"#faq","title":"FAQ"}],"children":[["$","$L3",null,{"children":"Open source and Enterprise"}],["$","$L4",null,{"children":"What the open-source distribution actually contains, which two modules are licensed differently, why nothing in the binary enforces that, and what the paid tiers are for."}],["$","$L5",null,{"children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Who this is for:"}]," anyone who has to answer \"are we allowed to run this?\",\nand anyone deciding between self-hosting and Forge Enterprise. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"What you'll\nhave at the end:"}]," an accurate picture of what is licensed how, what activates\nit, and what the open-source build does and does not restrict. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Time:"}]," ten\nminutes."]}],"\n",["$","div",null,{"className":"my-6 flex gap-3 rounded-xl border px-5 py-4 border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-50/60 text-foreground dark:bg-amber-500/10","role":"alert","children":[["$","svg",null,{"width":"20","height":"20","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"1.75","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M12 9v4m0 4h.01M10.29 3.86 1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0Z"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex-1 [&>p]:my-0 [&>p+p]:mt-2","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-1 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]","children":"This page describes the repository, not your legal position"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Everything below is checkable against the source tree at the commit you are\nreading: file paths, licence headers, and the code that reaches them. None\nof it is legal advice, and the operative text is the\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"https://forge.com/license","children":"licence page"}]," and the ",["$","code",null,{"children":"LICENSE"}]," file in the\nrepository root, not this page. If your intended use is near a boundary,\nread those and ask."]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","$L7",null,{"as":"h2","id":"the-short-version","children":"The short version"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["The whole of Forge is in the public repository. No separate\n\"enterprise build\", no stripped-down community edition, and no compile-time\nfeature flag that divides them. What differs between the free and paid product\nis the ",["$","em",null,{"children":"licence you hold"}],", not the ",["$","em",null,{"children":"code you run"}],"."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Two modules inside that one codebase carry a different licence from the rest.\nBoth are compiled into every binary, both are active by default, and nothing\nchecks whether you are entitled to them."}],"\n",["$","div",null,{"className":"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6","children":["$","table",null,{"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":