31:["$","p",null,{"children":["prints the crate version (",["$","code",null,{"children":"1.6.5"}]," at the time of writing) and exits. The\ncontainer image is tagged with the same version prefixed by ",["$","code",null,{"children":"v"}],"\n(",["$","code",null,{"children":"ghcr.io/tracemachina/forge:v1.6.5"}],"); pin that tag in production rather\nthan a floating one. See\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/reference/cli-and-env","children":"CLI and environment"}]," for the complete flag surface,\nwhich is ",["$","code",null,{"children":"--help"}]," and ",["$","code",null,{"children":"--version"}]," and nothing else, and\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/how-to/upgrade-versions","children":"Upgrade versions"}]," for moving between them."]}]
